  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Finely chop or crush garlic.\n• In a medium saucepan, heat the butter with a dash of olive oil over medium heat.\n• Cook 1/2 the garlic until fragrant, 1-2 mins. Add basmati rice, the water (for the rice) and a generous pinch of salt, stir, then bring to the boil.\n• Reduce heat to low and cover with a lid.\n• Cook for 10 mins, then remove from heat and keep covered until rice is tender and the water absorbed, 10 mins.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/698d0396ca20a4fa52b4246d/step-0a550700.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Meanwhile, roughly chop tomato.\n• Grate carrot.\n• Drain and rinse red kidney beans.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/698d0396ca20a4fa52b4246d/step-91694010.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• In a large frying pan, heat a drizzle of olive oil over medium-high heat. Cook carrot until softened, 3-4 mins.\n• Add jerk seasoning, tomato paste, tomato, beans and remaining garlic and cook until fragrant, 1-2 mins.\n• Stir through coconut milk, the stock powder, water (for the stew) and brown sugar. Simmer until thickened, 2-3 mins. Stir in baby spinach until wilted, 1 min. Season to taste.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/698d0396ca20a4fa52b4246d/step-409bb520.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Divide garlic rice and jerk kidney bean stew between bowls.\n• Sprinkle over the chilli flakes (if using) and tear over coriander to serve.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/698d0396ca20a4fa52b4246d/step-b377d530.jpg"
    }
  ]
